{#- The current notice (i18n → notice): the Zoom link changed on October 25. Shown on the home page
    and on How to join, just above the Zoom details. Empty notice.text hides it everywhere; the first
    build after the workshop has ended drops it too (when.status, worked out at build time). -#}
{% if t.notice and t.notice.text and not when.status.isPast %}
<div class="notice" role="note">
  {% icon "info", "icon" %}
  <p><strong>{{ t.notice.label }}.</strong> {{ t.notice.text | tokens }}</p>
</div>
{% endif %}
